{
 "task_id": "web-word-universe",
 "prompts": [
  "Words are tied to each other, and nobody here can see how. {WS}/site is a saved copy of a Portuguese creative dictionary. Explore this universe of words: collect what the site knows and build {WS}/universe/index.html, a single file that sums the universe up in one view and lets someone search for a word and find how it relates to others. The best way to show it is your call, and that view is what we care about most. So people can share a word, opening the page with ?word=saudade must show that word and its relations. Save the data as {WS}/words.json, mapping each word to the words it is linked to, and record in {WS}/result.json: words (how many), relations (how many distinct pairs) and most_connected. It is reviewed by opening the file, with no build step, in a browser that reaches only Google Fonts and https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.170.0/build/three.module.js."
 ],
 "answers": [
  "I've built the page, `./universe/index.html`, plus `words.json` and `result.json`. I haven't opened the page in a browser yet, so the 3D view and the `?word=` link are untested. What I did check: the data numbers below come straight from the extraction script, and `saudade` is in the embedded data.\n\n**What the site knows**\n- **253 words**, all with their own page in `site/`. There are 256 HTML files; 3 have no word heading and are site pages, not entries.\n- **732 distinct pairs of related words.**\n- **Most connected word: \"palavra\"**, with 16 links. Next come \"tempo\", \"advogado\", \"alma\" and \"almoço\".\n- `?word=saudade` should show its relations: ansiedade, carinho, dor, esperança, nostalgia.\n\n**How I read the saved site**\n- **Only the entry's own lists count.** Each page has a \"Sinônimos\" list and a \"Palavras análogas\" list. The \"Palavras do dia\" sidebar and the \"Mais buscadas\" footer show the same links on every page, so I ignored them. Counting them would have made \"mar\", \"café\" and \"amor\" look falsely central.\n- **Words are named by the page they link to.** Link text is inconsistent (`TRABALHO`, `cha` for chá, `Cafe.html` for café), so each link takes its name from the target page's title, in lowercase. That way no word is counted twice under different spellings.\n- **Links to pages that don't exist were dropped.** Examples are `link-antigo`, `pagina-removida`, `rascunho-3`, `xpto-2`, plurals like `saudades` and `corações`, and unaccented forms like `mao` and `avo`. Keeping them would have added 14 non-words, for 267 words and 775 pairs.\n- **Every link is treated as two-way**, so a pair is counted once whichever page lists it.\n\n**The view**\n- All the words appear as a single rotating 3D cloud of stars, built with three.js. Each star is coloured by its theme (comida, sentimentos, natureza…) and sized by how many links it has. Related words sit close together.\n- Search with autocomplete, or click a star, and the camera flies to that word. Its relations light up and get labels; everything else fades.\n- The side panel splits the relations into synonyms and similar words, and clicking any of them moves to it.\n- The address bar updates to `?word=…`, so the current word can be shared. A word that isn't in the dictionary gets a \"not in the universe\" message.\n\n**The files**\n- `words.json` maps each word to a sorted list of the words it is linked to.\n- `result.json` holds the three requested fields, plus the degree of the most connected word (16)."
 ],
 "diff": "A result.json\nA universe/index.html\nA words.json\n\n--- result.json ---\n{\r\n \"words\": 253,\r\n \"relations\": 732,\r\n \"most_connected\": \"palavra\",\r\n \"most_connected_degree\": 16\r\n}\n\n--- universe/index.html ---\n<!doctype html><html lang=\"pt-BR\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Universo de palavras</title>\r\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@400;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\r\n<style>body{margin:0;background:#05060d;color:#e8e6f0;font-family:Fraunces,Georgia,serif;overflow:hidden}\r\n#ui{position:fixed;top:16px;left:16px;width:320px;max-height:92vh;overflow:auto;background:#0d1020cc;padding:16px;border-radius:12px;backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}\r\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:22px}input{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:8px;font:inherit;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #445;background:#111527;color:#fff;margin-top:8px}\r\n.w{cursor:pointer;display:inline-block;margin:2px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;background:#1c2140}.w:hover{background:#334}\r\nsmall{color:#99a}#leg span{margin-right:8px;font-size:12px}#tip{position:fixed;pointer-events:none;background:#000a;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px;display:none}</style></head><body>\r\n<div id=\"ui\"><h1>Universo de palavras</h1><small id=\"stats\"></small>\r\n<input id=\"q\" list=\"dl\" placeholder=\"buscar palavra… ex.: saudade\"><datalist id=\"dl\"></datalist>\r\n<div id=\"info\"><small>Clique numa estrela ou busque uma palavra. Arraste para girar, role para aproximar.</small></div><div id=\"leg\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div></div><div id=\"tip\"></div>\r\n<script>const DATA={\"t\": {\"acento\": \"linguagem\", \"açougueiro\": \"ofícios\", \"açúcar\": \"comida\", \"advogado\": \"ofícios\", \"afeto\": \"sentimentos\", \"aflição\": \"sentimentos\", \"água\": \"comida\", \"aldeia\": \"lugares\", \"alegria\": \"sentimentos\", \"alfaiate\": \"ofícios\", \"alma\": \"corpo\", \"almoço\": \"comida\", \"amanhã\": \"tempo\", \"amor\": \"s